      <h2 class="prog-section__heading">STAND, PEEL and the Spheres of Influence: a real model answer, annotated</h2>
      <p class="prog-section__sub">From our own STAND/PEEL model-answer book, built on real SEAB Spoken Interaction prompts (2022&ndash;2025). This is the material students learn from.</p>

      <div class="oral-quickref">
